    "detailed_description": "Welcome to the <strong>Speakeasy</strong>!<br><br>This is Japan, where the prohibition of alcohol has been enforced. Kirishima, a high school teacher, wanders into a &quot;Speakeasy,&quot; an underground bar run in secret.<br><br>--There he meets a <strong>mafia boss</strong>?!<br><br>The bar, run by a certain mafia, has three charming individuals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2501500/extras/c2274c8a380ce45ffd76d27b00fa61a2.avif?t=1698620479\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2501500/extras/ae057b4ce5f795e136cd666ed9464ea0.avif?t=1698620479\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2501500/extras/577f81f4db6e03a122e5e393a1a5dab7.avif?t=1698620479\" /></span><br><strong>Misato</strong> - the sophisticated bartender <br><strong>Mary</strong> - the adorable poster girl<br><strong>Boss</strong> - the suave mafia boss who even men fall in love with.<br><br>With the heartwarming theme of companionship, have conversations with these intriguing individuals and enjoy your time at the <strong>Speakeasy</strong>!",
